---
// Contact CTA - YAWARA-style horizontal visual
---

<section class="contact section" id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact__card motion-scale">
      <div class="contact__inner">
        <div class="contact__copy">
          <h2 class="contact__title">
            まずは無料体験から<br />
            始めてみませんか？
          </h2>
          <p class="contact__text">
            見学・体験ともに無料です。お気軽にお問い合わせください。<br />
            動きやすい服装でお越しいただければ手ぶらで参加いただけます。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact__actions">
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/tshr_jiujitsu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact__btn contact__btn--trial">
            <span>無料体験レッスンに参加する</span>
            <svg class="contact__btn-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.8">
              <path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://line.me/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact__btn contact__btn--line">
            <span>LINEで相談する</span>
            <svg class="contact__btn-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.8">
              <path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact {
    padding: 0;
    background: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .contact .container {
    max-width: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .contact__card {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: clamp(300px, 36vw, 430px);
    padding: clamp(42px, 5vw, 72px) clamp(26px, 4vw, 56px);
      background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.52) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.34) 45%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42) 100%),
      url('/last.webp') center / cover no-repeat;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 0 !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
  }

  .contact__inner {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    min-height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: clamp(26px, 4vw, 54px);
  }

  .contact__copy {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 730px;
  }

  .contact__title {
    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 4.1rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
    line-height: 1.38;
    margin-bottom: clamp(16px, 2vw, 24px);
    text-shadow: 0 2px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.36);
  }

  .contact__text {
    font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.3vw, 1.9rem);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.34);
  }

  .contact__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 18px;
    width: min(100%, 360px);
    flex: 0 0 min(100%, 360px);
  }

  .contact__btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 76px;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.1vw, 1.25rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
      box-shadow 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
      background-color 0.4s ease;
  }

  .contact__btn-arrow {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    transition: transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .contact__btn--trial {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    color: #000000;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
  }

  .contact__btn--line {
    background: #82BE6A;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  .contact__btn:hover {
    transform: translate(10px, 10px);
  }

  .contact__btn:hover .contact__btn-arrow {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contact { padding: 0; }

    .contact__card {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 34px 22px 32px;
      border-radius: 0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.58) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) 100%),
        url('/last.webp') center / cover no-repeat;
    }

    .contact__inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .contact__copy {
      max-width: none;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .contact__title {
      font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 7vw, 2rem);
      line-height: 1.45;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .contact__text {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .contact__actions {
      width: 100%;
      flex: 1 1 auto;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .contact__btn {
      min-height: 64px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      padding: 14px 18px;
    }

    .contact__btn:hover {
      transform: translate(6px, 6px);
    }
  }
</style>


